                                        "entry_id": "9f13535a-acd5-3559-a603-74a976e386ff",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An instruction to play gradually more loudly, denoted by a long, narrow angle with its apex on the left ( < ), by musicians called a hairpin."
                                        ],
